# ===== Data (raw & processed) =====
# Raw data and large intermediate files are excluded (regenerable via notebooks 01-07).
# Small, genuinely useful outputs (dashboard data, DB, saved models) ARE tracked.
data/raw/**
!data/raw/.gitkeep

data/processed/combined_raw_dataset.csv/**
data/processed/cleaned_dataset.csv/**
data/processed/cleaned_dataset_single.csv
data/processed/cleaned_dataset_final.csv
data/processed/features_dataset.parquet/**
data/processed/dashboard_data.csv/**
# dashboard_data_final.csv (74MB) is intentionally NOT ignored - tracked so the
# dashboard is runnable without regenerating the full pipeline.

